{"id":411,"date":"2008-07-22T20:16:17","date_gmt":"2008-07-22T18:16:17","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=58"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:20:20","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:20:20","slug":"les-beaux-nuages-de-tags-de-wordle","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2008\/07\/22\/les-beaux-nuages-de-tags-de-wordle\/","title":{"rendered":"Les beaux nuages de tags de Wordle"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Il n&rsquo;y a pas si longtemps que les \u00ab\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/2006\/11\/22\/les-tag-clouds\/\">Tag Coulds<\/a>\u00a0\u00bb se sont impos\u00e9s comme des repr\u00e9sentations graphiques<\/p>\n<p>Sur <a href=\"http:\/\/wordle.net\/\" target=\"_blank\">Wordle.net<\/a> vous pouvez d\u00e9sormais cr\u00e9er de magnifiques nuages de tags \u00e0 partir :<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>d&rsquo;un texte quelconque copi\u00e9\/coll\u00e9<\/li>\n<li>d&rsquo;une URL fournissant un flux RSS<\/li>\n<li>d&rsquo;un nom de compte del.icio.us<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Le cloud suivant donne les tags de <a href=\"http:\/\/del.icio.us\/goulu\" target=\"_blank\">mon compte del.icio.us<\/a> :<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2008\/07\/wordle.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-59\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2008\/07\/wordle.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"655\" height=\"236\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Les couleurs, la police de caract\u00e8re et la disposition du tout peut \u00eatre ajust\u00e9e \u00e0 volont\u00e9. Notez l&rsquo;algorithme de disposition qui va jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 placer de tout petis mots dans le trou du grand D de 3D ! Vous trouverez sur <a href=\"http:\/\/wordle.net\/\" target=\"_blank\">Wordle.net<\/a> de nombreux magnifiques exemples.<\/p>\n<p>Il ne reste plus qu&rsquo;\u00e0 en faire une version dynamique int\u00e9grable dans WordPress&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Il n&rsquo;y a pas si longtemps que les \u00ab\u00a0Tag Coulds\u00a0\u00bb se sont impos\u00e9s comme des repr\u00e9sentations graphiques Sur Wordle.net vous<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[136,82,90,129],"class_list":["post-411","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-del-icio-us","tag-graphiques","tag-tags","tag-wordle"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/411","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=411"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/411\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1774,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/411\/revisions\/1774"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=411"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=411"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=411"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}